 border-radius: 2px; opacity: 1;">Visa</span><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text); white-space: nowrap; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);"><img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=mastercard.com&amp;sz=64" alt="Mastercard logo" width="13" height="13" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: block; width: 13px; height: 13px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 2px; opacity: 1;">Mastercard</span></div></div></div></section><section style="padding: 60px 24px 20px;"><div class="atmos-cool-dark" style="background: var(--ink); color: var(--dark-text); border-radius: 20px; padding: 0px; overflow: hidden; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto; box-shadow: var(--shadow-elevated);"><div class="lite-stakes-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0px;"><div class="lite-stakes-left" style="padding: 40px 44px 42px; border-right: 1px solid var(--dark-border);"><div class="section-heading sm on-dark">What is invisible value <span class="accent">costing you?</span></div><div style="margin-top: 28px;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark-muted);">Annual online revenue</span><b class="num" style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--dark-text);">$20,000,000</b></div><input type="range" min="120000" max="120000000" step="120000" aria-label="Annual online revenue" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 14px; accent-color: var(--dark-text);" value="20000000"></div><div style="margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--dark-border);"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark-muted);">AI-assisted share of sales</span><b class="num" style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--dark-text);">20%</b></div><input type="range" min="5" max="40" aria-label="AI-assisted share of sales" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 14px; accent-color: var(--dark-text);" value="20"></div><div class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9px; color: var(--dark-faint); margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--dark-border); line-height: 1.7;">MODELED FROM YOUR INPUTS · SAME MODEL AS YOUR FULL REPORT</div></div><div style="padding: 40px 44px 42px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;"><div><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--amber-tint); color: var(--amber-deep); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 560; letter-spacing: 0.01em; white-space: nowrap;"><span style="display: inline-block; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--amber); flex-shrink: 0;"></span>Modeled</span></div><div style="font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--dark-text); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.008em;">Modeled annual revenue exposed to invisible value</div><div class="num lite-display-num" style="font-size: 52px; font-weight: 740; letter-spacing: -0.038em; line-height: 1; color: var(--dark-text); margin-top: 20px;">$3,400,000</div><div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--dark-muted); line-height: 1.62; margin-top: 20px; max-width: 400px;">Assumes agents currently find you 0% of the time — the full picture, including what agents already see, comes from a Parleo audit.</div><div style="margin-top: 24px;"><a href="#run" class="lite-stakes-cta" style="text-decoration: none;"><button class="btn-lift" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.005em; padding: 11px 24px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; background: var(--blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid transparent;"><span>See your real number, run the free audit</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></a></div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--dark-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--dark-border);">And it's closable: <b style="color: var(--dark-text);">TrueSync</b>, Parleo's fix layer, encodes the value agents are missing.</div></div></div></div></section><section style="position: relative; isolation: isolate; padding: 70px 24px 12px; overflow: hidden;"><div aria-hidden="true" class="texture-dots-faint" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; z-index: 0;"></div><div style="position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto;"><div style="text-align: left;"><h2 class="section-heading sm">Trade &amp; Retail Media Spend that never reaches the agent. <span style="color: rgba(70, 69, 85, 0.42); font-weight: 640; letter-spacing: -0.024em;">We measured it.</span></h2><p class="section-copy" style="margin-top: 18px; max-width: 560px;">Two findings from our own scans. Both are the same failure: value that exists, funded and live, that no agent could read.</p></div><div class="lite-field-evidence-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 34px; align-items: stretch;"><div style="position: relative; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; padding: 15px 24px 14px;"><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 8px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background: var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3.5px 9px; flex-shrink: 0;">CASE 01</span><img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=brooklinen.com&amp;sz=64" alt="Brooklinen logo" width="18" height="18" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: block; width: 18px; height: 18px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 2.5200000000000005px; opacity: 1;"><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted);">CHATGPT · BEDDING QUERY · OUR SCAN</span></div><div style="padding: 4px 24px 0px;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Newsreader&quot;, Georgia, serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.42; letter-spacing: -0.014em; color: var(--text-strong);">"Brooklinen’s Luxe set is $269… members pay $228.65 — never mentioned."</div></div><div style="margin: 22px 24px 0px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 17px; background: var(--surface-warm);"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);"><img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=openai.com&amp;sz=64" alt="ChatGPT logo" width="15" height="15" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: block; width: 15px; height: 15px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 2.1px; opacity: 1;"></span><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;"><div class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted);">WHAT THE AGENT QUOTED</div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-top: 2px;">Luxe Core Sheet Set · queen</div></div><span class="num" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.026em; color: var(--faint); text-decoration: line-through; flex-shrink: 0;">$269.00</span></div><div class="atmos-cool-dark" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 15px 17px; background: var(--ink);"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; fl