"><button class="btn-lift" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.005em; padding: 11px 24px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; background: var(--blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid transparent;"><span>Open the full sample report</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></a><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9px; color: var(--faint);">MODELED EXPOSURE $775K / YR</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section style="padding: 60px 24px 12px;"><div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto;"><div style="text-align: left;"><h2 class="section-heading sm">The Share of Algorithm framework <span style="color: rgba(70, 69, 85, 0.42); font-weight: 640; letter-spacing: -0.024em;">scores 100 points.</span></h2><p class="section-copy" style="margin-top: 18px; max-width: 560px;">Three pillars, eight dimensions, one straight sum. Every point traces back to something an agent could or could not read on your site. Two pillars are table stakes. The third decides whether your value reaches the answer.</p></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 30px;"><div class="lite-framework-row-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr; gap: 26px; align-items: start; padding: 24px 26px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);"><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.09); flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":rs:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:rs:)"><path d="M1.5 8s2.4-4.5 6.5-4.5S14.5 8 14.5 8s-2.4 4.5-6.5 4.5S1.5 8 1.5 8Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.1"></circle></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><span class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 720; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.025em;">40<span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--faint);"> pts</span></span></div><div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.018em; margin-top: 13px;">Visibility</div><div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 5px;">Are you in the room when shoppers ask?</div></div><div class="lite-framework-tiles-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); gap: 10px; align-items: stretch;"><div style="min-width: 0px; padding: 14px 16px 13px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--canvas-dim); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25;">Share of Mentions</span><span class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 680; color: var(--text); flex-shrink: 0;">25</span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center;"><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--text-strong);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--text-strong);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--text-strong);"></i><i style="display: block; fle