lex; gap: 2px; align-items: center;"><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i></div><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: auto;">Can agents state your real price, and do they.</span></div><div style="min-width: 0px; padding: 14px 16px 13px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25;">Member Value</span><span class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 680; color: var(--blue); flex-shrink: 0;">15</span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center;"><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i></div><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: auto;">Can agents see what members get, and do they say it.</span></div><div style="min-width: 0px; padding: 14px 16px 13px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25;">Deal Citability</span><span class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 680; color: var(--blue); flex-shrink: 0;">6</span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center;"><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i></div><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: auto;">Do live promotions survive into answers.</span></div><div style="min-width: 0px; padding: 14px 16px 13px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25;">Value Protocols</span><span class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 680; color: var(--blue); flex-shrink: 0;">7</span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center;"><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i><i style="display: block; flex: 1 1 0%; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hairline);"></i></div><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: auto;">Can your value execute inside agent checkout. Almost no store declares anything here yet.</span></div></div></div></div><p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--muted); text-wrap: pretty;"><b style="color: var(--text-strong); font-weight: 640;">Every True Value dimension is dual-lens:</b> what your pages encode, and what agents actually said. The visibility tools you already pay for measure the first pillar only.</p></div></section><section style="padding: 34px 24px 30px;"><div class="lite-landing-grounded-grid" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch;"><div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 11px; background: var(--canvas-dim);"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":rv:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:rv:)"><path d="M2.8 8.6l3.4 3.4 7-7.6"></path></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><b style="font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.014em;">Every number above is measured</b></div><div style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.68; margin-top: 14px; text-wrap: pretty;">The audit reads the open standards agents actually read (schema.org, UCP, ACP) and scores them deterministically, so you can inspect every point. One run is a sample of agent behavior. The Full Analysis runs the category study.</div><div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 18px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--faint);"><span style="padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--green); color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px;">observed</span><span>24 queries, ChatGPT only, deterministic</span></div></div></div><div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.28); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 26px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.09);"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":r10:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:r10:)"><path d="M8 2l6.5 3.2L8 8.4 1.5 5.2 8 2ZM2.6 8.4L8 11l5.4-2.6M2.6 11.4L8 14l5.4-2.6"></path></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><b style="font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.014em;">Already running Profound or Bluelight? Keep them</b></div><div style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.68; margin-top: 14px; text-wrap: pretty;">They track whether agents mention you. This audit measures whether your real price and value survive when they do.</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px;"><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; background: var(--canvas-dim); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 13px;"><div class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted);">THEY MEASURE</div><div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); margin-top: 6px;">Whether you are mentioned</div></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; background: var(--blue-tint); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 13px;"><div class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9px; color: var(--blue);">WE MEASURE</div><div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-strong); font-weight: 540; margin-top: 6px;">Whether your value survives</div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="truesync" style="padding: 56px 24px 16px; scroll-margin-top: 90px;"><div style="position: relative; background: var(--container); border-top: 2px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 16px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 34px 40px 36px;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); white-space: nowrap; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--blue);">TRUESYNC</span><div style="margin-top: 16px;"><div style="text-align: left;"><h2 class="section-heading sm">The audit finds the gaps. <span style="color: rgba(70, 69, 85, 0.42); font-weight: 640; letter-spacing: -0.024em;">TrueSync closes them.</span></h2></div></div><p class="section-copy" style="margin: 14px 0px 0px; max-width: 640px; font-size: 15px;">The audit measures four gap areas. Parleo fixes two of them directly: <b style="color: var(--text-strong); font-weight: 620;">incentive sync</b> (your member value and deals, encoded and current) and <b style="color: var(--text-strong); font-weight: 620;">protocol declarations</b> (your value wired into UCP and ACP agent checkout).</p><div class="lite-truesync-landing-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 14px; margin-top: 26px;"><div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 20px 18px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.09);"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":r11:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:r11:)"><path d="M4 1.5h5.5L13 5v9.5H4V1.5ZM9.5 1.5V5H13M6 8h4M6 10.7h4"></path></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--blue);">01 ENCODE</span></div><b style="display: block; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-strong); margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.014em;">Member value and deals</b><span style="display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 5px;">In markup agents can read.</span></div><div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 20px 18px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.09);"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":r12:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:r12:)"><path d="M1.5 4.2h13v8h-13v-8ZM1.5 6.8h13M3.6 10h3"></path></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--blue);">02 DECLARE</span></div><b style="display: block; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-strong); margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.014em;">Value at agent checkout</b><span style="display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 5px;">UCP and ACP declarations.</span></div><div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 20px 18px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(1, 102, 255, 0.09);"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.15em;"><mask id=":r13:"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="13.1" cy="2.9" r="3.5" fill="#000"></circle></mask><g mask="url(#:r13:)"><path d="M13.5 6.5a5.7 5.7 0 0 0-10.4-1.2M2.5 2.7v3.1h3.1M2.5 9.5a5.7 5.7 0 0 0 10.4 1.2M13.5 13.3v-3.1h-3.1"></path></g><rect x="11.95" y="0.85" width="2.3" height="4.1" rx="1.15" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--blue);">03 STAY IN SYNC</span></div><b style="display: block; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-strong); margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.014em;">No drift back to zero</b><span style="display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 5px;">Updated as offers change.</span></div></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 26px;"><a href="https://parleo.io" style="text-decoration: none;"><button class="btn-lift" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.005em; padding: 11px 24px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; background: var(--blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid transparent;"><span>Talk to us about TrueSync</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></a><span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);">or start with the free audit above. Same road.</span></div></div></div></section><section style="padding: 8px 24px 40px;"><div class="ink-photo lite-finalcta-panel" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto; border-radius: 20px; padding: 74px 40px 78px; text-align: center;"><h2 class="section-heading sm on-dark" style="margin: 0px;">Find out what agents are missing.</h2><div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 26px auto 0px; text-align: left;"><div><form><div class="lite-form-compact-row" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><label style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px);" for=":r14:-primary">Your brand or store URL</label><input id=":r14:-primary" type="text" placeholder="yourstore.com" style="flex: 1 1 220px; min-width: 0px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-strong); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 999px; padding: 14px 20px; outline: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);" value=""><button class="btn-lift" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.005em; padding: 14px 30px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; background: var(--blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid transparent;"><span>Run my free audit</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 180, 180); margin-top: 8px; min-height: 16px;"> </div><div style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--dark-muted);">We'll identify your closest competitors automatically.</div></form></div></div><div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--dark-muted); margin-top: 16px;">Free, no email to start, ready in 10–20 minutes, <a href="http://audit.localhost:8000/r/1710d72d74ee4a2ea6c9884c72cc96e2" style="color: var(--blue-lite); font-weight: 530;">see a sample first</a></div></div></section><div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);"><div class="lite-landing-footer-row" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6.6000000000000005px;"><svg width="14.49" height="12.600000000000001" viewBox="0 0 46 40" style="display: block; flex-shrink: 0;"><rect x="0" y="0" width="19" height="40" rx="6" fill="#0166FF"></rect><rect x="27" y="9" width="15" height="22" rx="5" fill="#7FB0FF"></rect></svg><span style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.015em; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1;">PARLEO</span></span><span style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--faint);">© 2026 Parleo, Inc.</span><span class="mono-label" style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--faint);">audit.parleo.io</span></div></div></div>"`;

